  "goodToKnow": "Ringen means to wrestle: Das Ringen ist eine olympische Sportart. Figuratively, it means to struggle: um Worte ringen (to struggle for words), nach Luft ringen (to gasp for air), mit sich ringen (to be torn), die Hände ringen (to wring one's hands). It's irregular like singen: rang, gerungen. Der Ringer is a wrestler. Don't confuse it with der Ring (ring)."
